{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>英國就業及退休保障部周五（27日）遭遇「嚴重網絡事件」，首相府發言人說，不排除有人發動惡意攻擊，但未有證據顯示數據外泄。就業及退休保障部為謹慎起見，暫停部分網上服務，不過正常的福利發放未受影響。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T04:23:57.073654+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T03:43:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T09:30:19.404570+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T04:17:28.379897+00:00","content_hash":"c4f207da48b76679022742388f026f42d7715f5b4d67629eaacfadafd8e0db4d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}